                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "My bipartisan legislation, the Restore Protections for Dialysis Patients Act, aims to ensure that individuals with end-stage renal disease (ESRD) continue to have equitable access to private health care and to provide protection of the Medicare Trust Fund. \n\nIt strengthens Medicare's future, saves taxpayer money, and allows Pennsylvanians to continue receiving the care they need without delay.\n\nRead my latest op-ed in the Erie Times-News @GoErie.\nhttps://t.co/ywWDbKzfV2",
